<title>USA: PennCorp Financial Group Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>PennCorp Financial Group Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.70		    $0.77</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.65		     0.71</p>
<p> Net			 22,242		   20,698</p>
<p> Revs		     148,370		  120,112</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	29,497		   23,797</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	37,102		   27,682</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.10		    $1.94</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.95		     1.87</p>
<p> Net			 67,497		   47,686</p>
<p> Revs		     417,972		  297,536</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	33,993		   22,693</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	28,038		   24,249</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes trading gains of $0.02 per share; a charge of $2.8 million, or about $0.08 per share, from higher than anticipated claims; an after-tax loss of $2.2 million, or $0.06 per share, primarily attributable to the realignment of the Integon Life Investment portfolio.</p>
<p>Q3 1995 includes trading gains of $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
